      "widgets_values": [
        "## ltx-i2v-hero-lab-example\n\nLTX-2.5 distilled AV hero (~5 s). LTX Community License \u2014 not Apache. $10M company-revenue cap.\nModels: ltx-2.5-22b-distilled-transformer-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors + gemma4-12b-with-proj-ltx-2.5-comfy-int8-convrot.safetensors (CLIP type ltxv) + ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors + ltx-2.5-audio-vae-bf16.safetensors.\n121 frames @ 24 fps \u2248 5 s. LoadImage default example.png; after draft set ez_still_draft_00001_.png.\ncopy prompt + seed from draft, do not restyle here.\nPRIMARY OUTPUT \u2014 MP4 via VHS_VideoCombine (video/h264-mp4, 24 fps). SaveImage frames secondary.\nGated HF: accept Lightricks/LTX-2.5. Disclose AI-generated media; do not strip provenance; do not distill.\nPrompt enhance: a Klein/Wan/LTX Prompt Enhance node sits upstream of CLIP. Leave Enhance off to use this canned prompt. Set Enhance true and XAI_API_KEY to rewrite a lazy sentence.\n"
